# Express API

Mount routes at `/api/v1`. Validate bodies with Zod. Middleware order: request id, pino, helmet, cors, rate limit, cookie, csrf, routes, error handler.

Every college query filters `tenant_id` from the session. `requireRole` guards the route. Super-admin is the only cross-tenant path.

```ts
// BAD
db("jobs").where({ id });
// GOOD
db("jobs").where({ id, tenant_id: req.tenantId });
```
